// QS331: the guest sshd's probe account (tools\provision-guest-sshd.ps1) under a folder tagged prod,
// for the case that reads the tag back off the tab. The folder's tag is the one being read, so the
// session carries none of its own.
{
  "name": "",
  "children": [
    {
      "name": "Customer",
      "tags": ["prod"],
      "children": [
        {
          "name": "probe",
          "host": "127.0.0.1",
          "settings": { "user": "probe", "port": 2240, "key": "C:\\ProgramData\\quickshell-cases\\probe_ed25519" }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
